3. Scout agent (vehicles, private sellers only)
Mission: Find high-value, underpriced vehicles from private sellers only.
• Filters:
	◦ Private seller only
	◦ Make/model/year ranges you define
	◦ Max price, mileage, distance
• Signals:
	◦ Price vs KBB / market avg
	◦ Time on market
	◦ Red flags (salvage, missing title, weird description)
• Output:
	◦ Shortlist with “mission-ready” score and reasons.
---
4. Machine/activity monitoring agent
Mission: Watch your system like a squad leader watching Marines under load.
• Metrics:
	◦ CPU % (favorites: top 5 processes)
	◦ Memory usage (favorites: top 5)
	◦ Disk usage & I/O
	◦ Network throughput
	◦ Internet speed test (periodic or on-demand)
• Outputs:
	◦ “Strain report” with bottlenecks.
	◦ Flags like:
		▪︎ “Browser with 42 tabs is consuming 2.3 GB RAM.”
		▪︎ “Background process X is pegging CPU at 35%.”
You already started this with your dashboard—this agent just formalizes the logic and language.
