5. Geo-politics agent
Mission: Track power, conflict, and human rights in a way that cuts through noise.
• Sources:
	◦ Transcripts from Vaush, HasanAbi, etc. (for commentary)
	◦ War/casualty reports
	◦ Human rights orgs
	◦ Hate crime / violence stats
• Rules:
	◦ Separate commentary from verified reporting.
	◦ Always label:
		▪︎ “Opinion/analysis”
		▪︎ “Confirmed data”
• Outputs:
	◦ Situation briefs:
		▪︎ “Theaters of conflict”
		▪︎ “Key actors”
		▪︎ “Human rights impact”
		▪︎ “Trend: escalation/de-escalation”
