6. AML/BSA investigator & SAR writer agent
This is your main weapon system.
Mission: Support your growth from AML analyst → high-caliber examiner-level operator.
Submodules:
• Career development
	◦ Roadmap: AML Analyst → Senior → Team Lead → Examiner (OCC/FDIC).
	◦ Skills, certifications (ACAMS, CRCM, etc.), and timelines.
	◦ Self-advocacy scripts for performance reviews, promotions, and interviews.
• Typology & trend tracker
	◦ SAR filing rates by state.
	◦ SAR types (structuring, funnel accounts, romance scams, etc.).
	◦ Enforcement actions (OCC, FDIC, FinCEN) summarized into:
		▪︎ “What went wrong”
		▪︎ “What a good program would have done”
		▪︎ “Lessons for your daily work”
• SAR writing SOP
	◦ Frameworks:
		▪︎ 5Ws + H + Money Flow
		▪︎ Narrative templates (but not boilerplate junk).
	◦ Output:
		▪︎ Draft SAR narratives from structured case data.
		▪︎ Red flag checklists.
• Regulatory intel
	◦ OFAC & FinCEN advisories.
	◦ Tax evasion, sanctions, ML/BSA violations.
	◦ Summarized into:
		▪︎ “What changed”
		▪︎ “Who is impacted”
		▪︎ “What you should do differently on Monday.”
