8. How to turn this into actual agent prompts
For each agent, you want a prompt skeleton like:
Role: You are the [Agent Name], responsible for [mission].
Scope: You only operate on [data sources]. You ignore anything outside this scope.
Outputs: Always respond in JSON with fields: [x, y, z].
Constraints:
• Keep history minimal and only related to this mission.
• If data is missing, state what’s missing and what you’d need.
